191:   NODE = Connection traversing PCIe as well as the interconnect between PCIe Host Bridges within a NUMA node
191:   PHB  = Connection traversing PCIe as well as a PCIe Host Bridge (typically the CPU)
191:   PXB  = Connection traversing multiple PCIe bridges (without traversing the PCIe Host Bridge)
191:   PIX  = Connection traversing at most a single PCIe bridge
191:   NV#  = Connection traversing a bonded set of # NVLinks
