137:   PHB  = Connection traversing PCIe as well as a PCIe Host Bridge (typically the CPU)
137:   PXB  = Connection traversing multiple PCIe bridges (without traversing the PCIe Host Bridge)
137:   PIX  = Connection traversing at most a single PCIe bridge
137:   NV#  = Connection traversing a bonded set of # NVLinks
