383:   PHB  = Connection traversing PCIe as well as a PCIe Host Bridge (typically the CPU)
383:   PXB  = Connection traversing multiple PCIe bridges (without traversing the PCIe Host Bridge)
383:   PIX  = Connection traversing at most a single PCIe bridge
383:   NV#  = Connection traversing a bonded set of # NVLinks
