289:   SYS  = Connection traversing PCIe as well as the SMP interconnect between NUMA nodes (e.g., QPI/UPI)
289:   NODE = Connection traversing PCIe as well as the interconnect between PCIe Host Bridges within a NUMA node
289:   PHB  = Connection traversing PCIe as well as a PCIe Host Bridge (typically the CPU)
289:   PXB  = Connection traversing multiple PCIe bridges (without traversing the PCIe Host Bridge)
289:   PIX  = Connection traversing at most a single PCIe bridge
289:   NV#  = Connection traversing a bonded set of # NVLinks
